<title>UK: IBCA rates L-Bank matador bond due 2007.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-Bank matador bond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Monday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg's (L-Bank) 10 bilion peseta 7.06 to 8.58 percent step-up matador bond due 2007.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
